  authored there so xcodebuild compiles them. Tests live in
  apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/ per the same convention.
- Xcode runner IS available (xcodebuild 26.5 / Swift 6.3.2 / swiftlint / swiftformat /
  xcodegen / pwsh), so the gate is NOT BLOCKED.
- The page (P7) is a self-contained central-state surface that COMPOSES the existing
  P3 X-Ray component library in apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/ (XRayControls,
  XRayHeader, XRayBucketChart, XRayFieldsTable presentational views + pure
  projections + value types), over one @Observable IngestXRayPageModel — the native
  parity of the web page owning vehicleId/windowSel/bucketSel and passing them down
  as props. No P3 component was edited; only its public/internal symbols are reused.

